Just be brave♪

295
00:15:08,160 --> 00:15:10,690
♪And learn from your mistakes♪

296
00:15:12,630 --> 00:15:15,290
♪If the human heart
is impossible to fathom♪

297
00:15:15,290 --> 00:15:17,420
♪Could selling my soul and body♪

298
00:15:17,420 --> 00:15:20,590
♪Bring me something more?♪

299
00:15:21,290 --> 00:15:28,020
♪Stroke by stroke,
I draw the perfect outline♪

300
00:15:28,850 --> 00:15:32,250
♪Sadness is blue♪

301
00:15:33,230 --> 00:15:36,470
♪How would you paint me?♪

302
00:15:37,470 --> 00:15:41,200
♪Layering, crossing, blending endlessly♪

303
00:15:41,300 --> 00:15:43,460
♪Painting without restraint♪

304
00:15:43,650 --> 00:15:46,240
♪Covering the person I used to be♪

305
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:50,430
♪If I could start over♪

306
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:54,500
♪I'd show more feeling
in every look and gesture♪

307
00:15:54,610 --> 00:15:57,250
♪Give me back my smile♪

308
00:15:57,850 --> 00:16:00,330
♪Find joy even in hardship♪

309
00:16:00,830 --> 00:16:06,070
♪Don't let the next version of me
be left with nothing♪
